==Battleground==
*4 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 5.33 seconds<sup>160f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*3 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 18.67 seconds<sup>560f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Scissoroo]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dober P.D]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**6 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
**5 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**1 [[Aku Gory]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
**3 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**1 [[Elizabeth the LVIth]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**2 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
**2 [[Scissoroo]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Take care of Scissoroo with [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] and [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]], start sending out [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cats]] once she dies. As soon as they trigger the boss wave, send out [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to start tearing through Dober P.D with the assistance of Octopus Cat's Wave Shield ability and a well-timed [[Ototo Corps#Thunderbolt|Thunderbolt]] Cannon. [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cat]] can take care of Elizabeth the LVIth together with the aforementioned units, even if you can't completely rush down Dober P.D. The constant peons mean there's cash aplenty, especially if you have Can Can's Extra Money [[Talents|Talent]].

